Results.ReviewText:
I do A LOT of grilling/smoking/baking on my traeger.  I have one I take camping, a few I take tailgating and it is just a superior piece of equipment.  I have had several friends, family members and strangers purchase grills of their own after eating one of my cooks.  Traeger makes grilling fun and easy.  Whether you imitate their recipes, tweak family recipes or experiment Traeger will not disappoint.  

-JP SLC, UT 
@traegerpapi
